# sacrificed and nothing is found, so Bot1 ends with one land fewer. A basic land in the other player's library is not found.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Cycle of Renewal
Elvish Mystic
Elvish Mystic
Elvish Mystic
Elvish Mystic
Tropical Island
Elvish Mystic x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
